      "Section": "Localized Profile Fields",
      "Anchor": "localized-profile-fields",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Localized profile fields are optional string values that default to the preferred locale of the member\u0027s profile. These fields are read-only and the values are copied over from the actual field object. If you perform profile edit, you will need to edit the original field objects.",
